{"title":"Career roadmap — Chef / Commis","role":"Chef / Commis","summary":"A Chef/Commis works in professional kitchens, supporting food preparation, mise en place, cooking, plating, kitchen hygiene and food-safety operations. A Commis is generally an entry-level culinary role, while the long-term pathway can progress through Chef de Partie → Sous Chef → Executive Chef.","facts":{"Current degree":"BHM / B.Sc Hospitality & Hotel Administration / BTTM","Course":"Hotel Management / Hospitality Administration"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"This career is highly practical. Hands-on kitchen experience, discipline, food-safety knowledge, consistency and culinary skill matter more than collecting academic certificates."}]},{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Master kitchen fundamentals, food safety, mise en place, basic cuisines and professional kitchen discipline; enter as Commis/Junior Cook."}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Progress to Demi Chef de Partie, Chef de Partie or speciality-cuisine roles."}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Move toward Sous Chef, Kitchen Supervisor or speciality-kitchen leadership."}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Progress to Executive Chef, Culinary Director, Corporate Chef or build an independent food business."}]]}]},{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Culinary foundations"},{"type":"p","text":"Master:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Kitchen terminology"},{"text":"Knife skills"},{"text":"Mise en place"},{"text":"Basic cooking methods"},{"text":"Stocks"},{"text":"Sauces"},{"text":"Soups"},{"text":"Eggs"},{"text":"Vegetables"},{"text":"Rice"},{"text":"Pasta"},{"text":"Meat and poultry basics"},{"text":"Seafood basics"},{"text":"Basic bakery"},{"text":"Basic pastry"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Food hygiene"},{"text":"Personal hygiene"},{"text":"Kitchen sanitation"},{"text":"Cross-contamination prevention"},{"text":"Food storage"},{"text":"Temperature control"},{"text":"FIFO"},{"text":"Food safety systems"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Develop professional habits:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Punctuality"},{"text":"Clean workstation"},{"text":"Speed"},{"text":"Consistency"},{"text":"Teamwork"},{"text":"Kitchen communication"},{"text":"Discipline"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Professional kitchen skills"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop proficiency in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Indian cuisine"},{"text":"Continental cuisine"},{"text":"Asian cuisine"},{"text":"Regional cuisines"},{"text":"Grill"},{"text":"Garde manger"},{"text":"Bakery"},{"text":"Pastry"},{"text":"Breakfast operations"},{"text":"Banquet production"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Recipe standardisation"},{"text":"Portion control"},{"text":"Food costing"},{"text":"Yield calculation"},{"text":"Kitchen inventory"},{"text":"Purchasing basics"},{"text":"Waste management"},{"text":"Menu planning"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Specialisation + kitchen management"},{"type":"p","text":"Choose a culinary specialisation:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Indian"},{"text":"Continental"},{"text":"Italian"},{"text":"French"},{"text":"Asian"},{"text":"Bakery"},{"text":"Pastry"},{"text":"Chocolate"},{"text":"Vegan/plant-based"},{"text":"Regional Indian cuisine"},{"text":"Fine dining"},{"text":"Institutional catering"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Develop:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Menu engineering"},{"text":"Food costing"},{"text":"Kitchen scheduling"},{"text":"Team coordination"},{"text":"Supplier management"},{"text":"Quality control"},{"text":"Kitchen productivity"},{"text":"Allergen management"},{"text":"HACCP principles"},{"text":"Food safety systems"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Final year — Industry readiness"},{"type":"p","text":"Complete substantial practical training in a professional kitchen."},{"type":"p","text":"Build a culinary portfolio containing:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"15–25 signature dishes"},{"text":"Recipe cards"},{"text":"Food-cost calculations"},{"text":"Plating photographs"},{"text":"Menu concepts"},{"text":"Regional cuisine project"},{"text":"Bakery/pastry project"},{"text":"Food-safety procedures"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Complete at least one serious hotel/restaurant internship."},{"type":"h","text":"Specialisation options"},{"type":"table","header":["Specialisation","Important skills","Potential roles"],"rows":[[{"text":"Indian Cuisine"},{"text":"Regional cooking, gravies, breads"},{"text":"Indian Chef"}],[{"text":"Continental"},{"text":"Sauces, grills, western cuisine"},{"text":"Continental Chef"}],[{"text":"Italian"},{"text":"Pasta, pizza, sauces"},{"text":"Italian Chef"}],[{"text":"Asian"},{"text":"Wok, noodles, regional Asian cuisine"},{"text":"Asian Chef"}],[{"text":"Bakery"},{"text":"Bread, fermentation"},{"text":"Baker"}],[{"text":"Pastry"},{"text":"Desserts, chocolate"},{"text":"Pastry Chef"}],[{"text":"Fine Dining"},{"text":"Precision, plating"},{"text":"Fine Dining Chef"}],[{"text":"Banquets"},{"text":"Volume production"},{"text":"Banquet Chef"}],[{"text":"Catering"},{"text":"Large-scale production"},{"text":"Catering Chef"}],[{"text":"Plant-based"},{"text":"Vegan cuisine"},{"text":"Plant-based Chef"}]]}]},{"heading":"Internships","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Best internship environments"},{"type":"p","text":"Target:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Luxury hotels"},{"text":"Business hotels"},{"text":"Resorts"},{"text":"Fine-dining restaurants"},{"text":"Standalone restaurants"},{"text":"QSR chains"},{"text":"Cloud kitchens"},{"text":"Cruise ships"},{"text":"Catering companies"},{"text":"Bakeries"},{"text":"Pastry houses"},{"text":"Institutional kitchens"},{"text":"Airline catering companies"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Internship roles"},{"type":"p","text":"Look for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Culinary Intern"},{"text":"Kitchen Intern"},{"text":"Commis Intern"},{"text":"Food Production Intern"},{"text":"Bakery Intern"},{"text":"Pastry Intern"},{"text":"Banquet Kitchen Intern"},{"text":"Food & Beverage Production Intern"}]},{"type":"h","text":"What to learn"},{"type":"p","text":"Gain practical exposure to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Mise en place"},{"text":"Kitchen stations"},{"text":"Food preparation"},{"text":"Service periods"},{"text":"Buffet production"},{"text":"À la carte service"},{"text":"Banquet production"},{"text":"Inventory"},{"text":"Food safety"},{"text":"Food costing"},{"text":"Kitchen hierarchy"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The best internship is one where the student actually spends substantial time working in the kitchen, rather than only observing."}]},{"heading":"Certifications and learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Area","Useful learning"],"rows":[[{"text":"Food Safety"},{"text":"Food-safety/HACCP training"}],[{"text":"Hospitality"},{"text":"Professional hospitality programmes"}],[{"text":"Culinary Arts"},{"text":"Cuisine-specific culinary training"}],[{"text":"Bakery"},{"text":"Baking and pastry certification"}],[{"text":"Wine & Beverage"},{"text":"Beverage knowledge where relevant"}],[{"text":"Nutrition"},{"text":"Basic nutrition and menu planning"}],[{"text":"Cost Control"},{"text":"Food-costing and inventory training"}],[{"text":"Management"},{"text":"Kitchen/team management"}],[{"text":"International"},{"text":"Cuisine-specific international training"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"Food-safety requirements and certifications should be aligned with the regulations and employer requirements of the country where the student intends to work."}]},{"heading":"Careers you can be hired as","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Direct roles"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Commis Chef"},{"text":"Junior Chef"},{"text":"Kitchen Associate"},{"text":"Food Production Associate"},{"text":"Trainee Chef"},{"text":"Bakery Commis"},{"text":"Pastry Commis"},{"text":"Kitchen Assistant"},{"text":"Cook"}]},{"type":"h","text":"After experience"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Demi Chef de Partie"},{"text":"Chef de Partie"},{"text":"Senior Chef de Partie"},{"text":"Specialist Chef"},{"text":"Pastry Chef"},{"text":"Bakery Chef"},{"text":"Banquet Chef"},{"text":"Kitchen Supervisor"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Long-term"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sous Chef"},{"text":"Executive Sous Chef"},{"text":"Executive Chef"},{"text":"Corporate Chef"},{"text":"Culinary Director"},{"text":"Group Executive Chef"},{"text":"Culinary Consultant"},{"text":"Restaurant Owner"},{"text":"Food Entrepreneur"}]}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate study in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["PG route","Best for"],"rows":[[{"text":"M.Sc. Hospitality Administration"},{"text":"Hospitality management"}],[{"text":"MBA Hospitality Management"},{"text":"Hospitality leadership"}],[{"text":"MBA Hotel Management"},{"text":"Hotel/business management"}],[{"text":"PG Diploma Culinary Arts"},{"text":"Advanced culinary skills"}],[{"text":"PG Diploma Bakery & Pastry"},{"text":"Pastry specialisation"}],[{"text":"Food Business Management"},{"text":"Food entrepreneurship"}],[{"text":"MBA Entrepreneurship"},{"text":"Restaurant/food business"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended route"},{"type":"p","text":"For a culinary career:"},{"type":"flow","items":["BHM","Commis","Chef de Partie","Sous Chef","Executive Chef"]},{"type":"p","text":"For management:"},{"type":"flow","items":["BHM","Culinary/Hotel experience","MBA Hospitality","F&B/Kitchen Management","Hotel/Restaurant Leadership"]},{"type":"p","text":"For entrepreneurship:"},{"type":"flow","items":["BHM","Professional kitchen experience","Culinary specialisation","Restaurant/Food Brand","Food Entrepreneur"]}]},{"heading":"Study abroad","kind":"abroad","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Country","Useful areas"],"rows":[[{"text":"🇫🇷 France"},{"text":"Culinary Arts, Gastronomy, Pâtisserie"}],[{"text":"🇮🇹 Italy"},{"text":"Culinary Arts, Italian Cuisine"}],[{"text":"🇨🇭 Switzerland"},{"text":"Hospitality & Culinary Management"}],[{"text":"🇺🇸 USA"},{"text":"Culinary Arts, Hospitality Management"}],[{"text":"🇬🇧 UK"},{"text":"Culinary Arts, Hospitality"}],[{"text":"🇦🇺 Australia"},{"text":"Culinary Management, Hospitality"}],[{"text":"🇨🇦 Canada"},{"text":"Culinary Management, Hospitality"}],[{"text":"🇸🇬 Singapore"},{"text":"Culinary & Hospitality Management"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"For international culinary careers, practical experience and a strong culinary portfolio can be more important than obtaining another general academic qualification."}]},{"heading":"Career progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Traditional kitchen pathway"},{"type":"flow","items":["Commis Chef","Demi Chef de Partie","Chef de Partie","Junior Sous Chef","Sous Chef","Executive Sous Chef","Executive Chef","Corporate/Group Executive Chef"]},{"type":"h","text":"Speciality pathway"},{"type":"flow","items":["Commis","Specialist Chef","Senior Specialist Chef","Chef de Partie","Sous Chef","Executive Chef"]},{"type":"h","text":"Entrepreneurship pathway"},{"type":"flow","items":["Commis","Chef","Specialised Chef","Pop-up/Catering","Food Brand","Restaurant/Food Business Owner"]},{"type":"note","label":"Emerging specialisations","text":"2030–2040"},{"type":"h","text":"1. AI-Assisted Culinary Development"},{"type":"p","text":"AI can assist chefs with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Recipe ideation"},{"text":"Menu development"},{"text":"Ingredient substitution"},{"text":"Demand forecasting"},{"text":"Food-cost optimisation"},{"text":"Waste reduction"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The chef's practical judgement and sensory evaluation remain essential."},{"type":"h","text":"2. Sustainable Culinary Operations"},{"type":"p","text":"Growing importance of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Local ingredients"},{"text":"Seasonal menus"},{"text":"Zero/low-waste cooking"},{"text":"Plant-based cuisine"},{"text":"Sustainable seafood"},{"text":"Responsible sourcing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"3. Nutrition-Focused Cuisine"},{"type":"p","text":"Opportunities will grow in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Healthy restaurants"},{"text":"Wellness resorts"},{"text":"Sports nutrition"},{"text":"Special-diet menus"},{"text":"Functional foods"},{"text":"Personalised nutrition concepts"}]},{"type":"h","text":"4. Cloud Kitchens & Food-Tech"},{"type":"p","text":"Chefs may increasingly work with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Delivery-only brands"},{"text":"Multi-brand kitchens"},{"text":"Automated kitchen systems"},{"text":"Food-tech platforms"},{"text":"Data-driven menu optimisation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"5. Culinary Entrepreneurship"},{"type":"p","text":"Chefs can build:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Restaurants"},{"text":"Bakeries"},{"text":"Cloud kitchens"},{"text":"Catering businesses"},{"text":"Food products"},{"text":"Cooking schools"},{"text":"Digital food brands"},{"text":"Hospitality consultancies"}]},{"type":"note","label":"2040–2046","text":"How the role evolves"},{"type":"p","text":"Technology may increasingly automate:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Inventory tracking"},{"text":"Recipe costing"},{"text":"Demand forecasting"},{"text":"Procurement"},{"text":"Kitchen scheduling"},{"text":"Standardised preparation"},{"text":"Waste monitoring"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Human value will remain strongest in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Taste"},{"text":"Creativity"},{"text":"Presentation"},{"text":"Menu storytelling"},{"text":"Leadership"},{"text":"Culinary innovation"},{"text":"Quality control"},{"text":"Guest experience"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The career therefore evolves from:"},{"type":"h","text":"\"Preparing food according to recipes.\""},{"type":"p","text":"toward:"},{"type":"p","text":"\"Creating distinctive culinary experiences while managing quality, cost, sustainability and technology-enabled kitchen operations.\""},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended final skill stack"},{"type":"h","text":"Culinary"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Knife skills"},{"text":"Cooking techniques"},{"text":"Mise en place"},{"text":"Indian cuisine"},{"text":"International cuisine"},{"text":"Plating"},{"text":"Recipe development"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Food safety"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Hygiene"},{"text":"HACCP principles"},{"text":"Food storage"},{"text":"Temperature control"},{"text":"Allergen awareness"},{"text":"Cross-contamination prevention"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Kitchen management"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Food costing"},{"text":"Inventory"},{"text":"Purchasing"},{"text":"Waste management"},{"text":"Menu planning"},{"text":"Team coordination"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technology"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"POS systems"},{"text":"Kitchen management systems"},{"text":"Inventory software"},{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Digital recipe management"},{"text":"AI culinary tools"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Professional"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Discipline"},{"text":"Speed"},{"text":"Creativity"},{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"Teamwork"},{"text":"Stress management"},{"text":"Leadership"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Target progression"},{"type":"note","label":"Year 1","text":"Culinary fundamentals + Food Safety"},{"type":"note","label":"Year 2","text":"Multi-cuisine skills + Professional kitchen operations"},{"type":"flow","items":["Specialisation","Food costing","Kitchen management"],"sep":"+","label":"Year 3"},{"type":"note","label":"Final Year","text":"Professional kitchen internship + Culinary portfolio"},{"type":"note","label":"0–2 years","text":"Commis Chef / Junior Chef"},{"type":"note","label":"3–5 years","text":"Chef de Partie / Specialist Chef"},{"type":"note","label":"5–8 years","text":"Sous Chef"},{"type":"note","label":"8–15 years","text":"Executive Chef / Culinary Director / Food Entrepreneur"},{"type":"h","text":"Best employability combination"},{"type":"flow","items":["BHM","strong culinary fundamentals","food safety","cuisine specialisation","food costing","professional kitchen experience","culinary portfolio","discipline."],"sep":"+"},{"type":"note","label":"Key principle","text":"A successful Chef does not simply cook individual dishes. The long-term professional must consistently deliver taste, quality, presentation, food safety and cost efficiency at scale, while eventually developing the leadership and creative skills required to manage a kitchen or build a food business."},{"type":"p","text":"This row is already covered above, so I would not generate a duplicate roadmap for ID 1347."},{"type":"note","label":"ID 1347","text":"Degree: BHM / B.Sc Hospitality & Hotel Administration / BTTM\nCourse: Hotel Management / Hospitality Administration\nCareer: F&B Service Executive"},{"type":"p","text":"The existing roadmap covers:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"F&B service and restaurant operations"},{"text":"Year-wise undergraduate skill development"},{"text":"Hotel/restaurant internships"},{"text":"POS, Excel, Power BI and F&B analytics"},{"text":"Food safety and guest experience"},{"text":"Upselling and revenue management"},{"text":"Postgraduate options in India and abroad"},{"text":"Government/public-sector pathways"},{"text":"Restaurant, banquet, luxury hospitality and analytics specialisations"},{"text":"AI-enabled hospitality"}]},{"type":"flow","items":["F&B Service Executive","Captain/Supervisor","F&B Manager","Director of F&B"],"label":"Career progression from"},{"type":"p","text":"1348 | BHM / B.Sc Hospitality & Hotel Administration / BTTM | Hotel Management / Hospitality Administration | Housekeeping Supervisor"}]}]}